            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[# Cranach Catalog Finder 1.0.5

This release makes the package workspace smaller, clearer, and easier to scan:

- the new transparent black Cranach wordmark replaces the boxed logo, with the
  extra Home-page tagline removed
- the five workspace tabs are centered in a clean header with catalog status
  details removed from its left and right edges
- Your Selections now keeps product choices prominent, moves compact package
  details and save controls to the bottom, and uses “Package name” in place of
  “Project or room”
- the global price section has been removed; each selected product still has
  its own clear Hide prices or Show prices control
- Clients, Previous packages, and Settings use shorter headings and tighter
  spacing so the first useful action appears sooner
- switching the Catalog from Outline to Cards now loads products immediately
  instead of leaving an empty view

This is an application-only update. It does not replace catalog data, saved
client work, current selections, or retained downloads.
]]></description>
